### Get access token for owner1
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/keepdishesgoing/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=keepdishesgoing&client_secret=GXg3zjaA8qrRFWFU06yhLrvLVI877xYE&username={{owner1username}}&password={{owner1password}}&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("session_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

